{"step_index":5145,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T07:57:59Z","thinking":"Examining the prior design document's section on safety levels will establish the expected structure and permissible actions for each security tier. The safety level definitions specify that levels 0 and 1 are always allowed. Level 2A allows single-file code edits within the project boundary with passing local tests and non-config changes. Level 2B, however, is a default deny and deals with multi-file and config changes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"{\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0\\\",\\n  \\\"last_updated\\\": \\\"2026-09-25T07:58:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"policy_mode\\\": \\\"autonomous_approval_less\\\",\\n  \\\"default_decision\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n  \\\"fail_closed_rules\\\": {\\n    \\\"unknown_agent\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n    \\\"unknown_tool\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n    \\\"unknown_project\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n    \\\"invalid_path\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n    \\\"path_traversal\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n    \\\"missing_policy\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n    \\\"timeout\\\": \\\"deny\\\",\\n    \\\"gateway_exception\\\": \\\"deny\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"levels\\\": {\\n    \\\"LEVEL_0\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"READ_ONLY\\\",\\n      \\\"decision\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Information inspection and research across whitelisted read paths\\\",\\n      \\\"allowed_tools\\\": [\\n        \\\"view_file\\\",\\n        \\\"search_web\\\",\\n        \\\"read_url_content\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"prohibited_tools\\\": [\\n        \\\"write_to_file\\\",\\n        \\\"replace_file_content\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    \\\"LEVEL_1\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"LOW_IMPACT_REVERSIBLE\\\",\\n      \\\"decision\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Safe diagnostics, cache clears, and project-local checks\\\",\\n      \\\"allowed_tools\\\": [\\n        \\\"run_command\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"c