{"step_index":5148,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T07:58:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-25T07:58:10Z\nCompleted At: 2026-09-25T07:58:10Z\nFile Path: `file:///home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/AGENTS.md`\nTotal Lines: 314\nTotal Bytes: 17890\nShowing lines 70 to 140\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n70: - **Request Classification:** Automatically classifies incoming requests into 8 distinct categories:\n71:   1. `general question`\n72:   2. `research`\n73:   3. `project work`\n74:   4. `multi-project work`\n75:   5. `monitoring`\n76:   6. `incident`\n77:   7. `corrective action`\n78:   8. `architecture decision`\n79: - **Authority:** Full orchestrator authority. Evaluates and approves Level 2B actions. Coordinates human confirmation for Level 3. Performs final acceptance of completed tasks.\n80: \n81: ### 2.2 ASKING & RESEARCH AGENT\n82: - **Identifier:** `agy:ask`\n83: - **Role:** Technical Researcher & General Question Assistant\n84: - **Workspace:** `/home/azureuser/Ask-And-Research`\n85: - **Boundary:** Global READ ONLY across all server projects and documentation.\n86: - **WhatsApp Behavior:** Connects directly to WhatsApp to answer general and technical inquiries (e.g., modern AI architectures, Rust diagnostics, Azure architecture).\n87: - **Hard Restriction:** Strict READ ONLY. Cannot modify production code, delete files, restart critical services, or execute destructive actions.\n88: \n89: ### 2.3 REPORTING AGENT (GLOBAL SENTINEL)\n90: - **Identifier:** `agy:report`\n91: - **Role:** Global Observability, Watchdog & Independent System Health Sentinel\n92: - **Workspace:** `/home/azureuser/Reporting-Agent`\n93: - **Boundary:** Global READ/AUDIT ONLY across all projects, process states, and logs.\n94: - **Primary Job