inside a single file with unit tests passing. | **Automated Policy Gate (No human block if tests pass)** |\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
